sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Клиент
    participant O as Orders / Saga
    participant B as Billing
    participant W as Warehouse
    participant D as Delivery
    C->>O: POST /orders + Idempotency-Key
    O->>O: Сохранить заказ, step=payment
    O->>B: charge(orderId, amount)
    B-->>O: succeeded
    O->>O: step=stock
    O->>W: reserve(orderId, sku, quantity)
    W-->>O: reserved
    O->>O: step=delivery
    O->>D: reserve(orderId, slotId)
    D-->>O: rejected / timeout
    O->>O: status=compensating, step=undo_delivery
    O->>D: release(orderId, slotId)
    D-->>O: released
    O->>O: step=undo_stock
    O->>W: release(orderId, sku, quantity)
    W-->>O: released
    O->>O: step=undo_payment
    O->>B: refund(orderId, amount)
    B-->>O: refunded
    O->>O: rejected + outbox одной транзакцией
    O-->>C: 201 rejected
    Note over O,D: При сбое компенсации: 202 compensating и повтор фоновым worker
